%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%9C%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4_%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97%E9%83%BD%E6%8A%A2%E7%9D%80%E5%8D%96%E6%9E%95%E5%A4%B4_/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 Jun 2025 02:09:03 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2025-06/%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%9C%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4_%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97%E9%83%BD%E6%8A%A2%E7%9D%80%E5%8D%96%E6%9E%95%E5%A4%B4_/</guid><description>为什么一夜之间，所有酒店都抢着卖枕头？ by 每日人物 如今，卖枕头的酒店又多了一家。继亚朵靠卖枕头业绩大涨之后，旗下拥有汉庭、全季等多家连锁酒店的华住集团，也推出了自家的枕头。</description></item><item><title>四个河南男人，掏空中产钱包</title><link>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2025-05/%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E7%94%B7%E4%BA%BA_%E6%8E%8F%E7%A9%BA%E4%B8%AD%E4%BA%A7%E9%92%B1%E5%8C%85/</link><pubDate>Fri, 16 May 2025 07:10:17 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2025-05/%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E7%94%B7%E4%BA%BA_%E6%8E%8F%E7%A9%BA%E4%B8%AD%E4%BA%A7%E9%92%B1%E5%8C%85/</guid><description>四个河南男人，掏空中产钱包 by 每日人物 蜜雪冰城、泡泡玛特、胖东来，或许是当前的消费赛道里，最炙手可热的三个玩家。年轻人为泡泡玛特的Labubu充值信仰，全国超市把胖东来当精神图腾，刚上市的蜜雪冰城则被二级市场追捧，股价一路飙升。</description></item><item><title>猛赚190亿，河南大佬过了一个肥年</title><link>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2025-02/%E7%8C%9B%E8%B5%9A190%E4%BA%BF_%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%AC%E8%BF%87%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%82%A5%E5%B9%B4/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Feb 2025 13:37:46 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2025-02/%E7%8C%9B%E8%B5%9A190%E4%BA%BF_%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%AC%E8%BF%87%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%82%A5%E5%B9%B4/</guid><description>猛赚190亿，河南大佬过了一个肥年 by 每日人物 牧原股份业绩大增，其掌舵者秦英林继续稳坐河南首富之位。</description></item><item><title>河南县城，成了中产的“扫货天堂”？</title><link>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2025-01/%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E5%8E%BF%E5%9F%8E_%E6%88%90%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%AD%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84_%E6%89%AB%E8%B4%A7%E5%A4%A9%E5%A0%82__/</link><pubDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2025 11:19:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2025-01/%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E5%8E%BF%E5%9F%8E_%E6%88%90%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%AD%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84_%E6%89%AB%E8%B4%A7%E5%A4%A9%E5%A0%82__/</guid><description>河南县城，成了中产的“扫货天堂”？ by 每日人物 冬天，是中产们展现“实力”的季节。几个北京中产往雪地里一站，好像在进行一场“军备竞赛”。我的朋友小K就深谙这个道理。</description></item><item><title>顶流胖东来，为什么走不出河南？</title><link>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2024-02/%E9%A1%B6%E6%B5%81%E8%83%96%E4%B8%9C%E6%9D%A5_%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E8%B5%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97_/</link><pubDate>Sat, 17 Feb 2024 02:41:48 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2024-02/%E9%A1%B6%E6%B5%81%E8%83%96%E4%B8%9C%E6%9D%A5_%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E8%B5%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%BA%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97_/</guid><description>顶流胖东来，为什么走不出河南？ by 每日人物 年前，胖东来再次以#胖东来一件羽绒服仅赚3毛钱#的话题冲上热搜，它像是商超界的“顶流网红”，一举一动都备受关注。但萦绕胖东来的始终有一个问题：为什么胖东来走不出河南？就算真的走出了河南，胖东来还会是胖东来吗？</description></item><item><title>儿童医院，难熬的一夜</title><link>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2023-11/%E5%84%BF%E7%AB%A5%E5%8C%BB%E9%99%A2_%E9%9A%BE%E7%86%AC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%9C/</link><pubDate>Sun, 26 Nov 2023 00:29:54 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2023-11/%E5%84%BF%E7%AB%A5%E5%8C%BB%E9%99%A2_%E9%9A%BE%E7%86%AC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%9C/</guid><description>儿童医院，难熬的一夜 by 每日人物 这是个家长们为生病的孩子发愁的冬天。</description></item><item><title>上海“一日夫妻”价值2000万</title><link>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2023-05/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7_%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%BB_%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC2000%E4%B8%87/</link><pubDate>Sat, 20 May 2023 04:30:47 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/2023-05/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7_%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%BB_%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC2000%E4%B8%87/</guid><description>上海“一日夫妻”价值2000万 by 每日人物 上海云锦东方三期虽然总价超过3000万，但每平米比周边二手房价低10万，摇中可能就赚上千万，这让高净值人群趋之若鹜，其火爆程度远超市场预期，但这也引发了人们对豪宅市场乱象的担忧和关注。</description></item><item><title>消失一年的薇娅，赚得比从前更多</title><link>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/others/%E6%B6%88%E5%A4%B1%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E7%9A%84%E8%96%87%E5%A8%85_%E8%B5%9A%E5%BE%97%E6%AF%94%E4%BB%8E%E5%89%8D%E6%9B%B4%E5%A4%9A/</link><pubDate>Wed, 16 Nov 2022 03:51:57 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ixxmu.github.io/posts/others/%E6%B6%88%E5%A4%B1%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E7%9A%84%E8%96%87%E5%A8%85_%E8%B5%9A%E5%BE%97%E6%AF%94%E4%BB%8E%E5%89%8D%E6%9B%B4%E5%A4%9A/</guid><description>消失一年的薇娅，赚得比从前更多 by 每日人物 薇娅从直播间消失已经300多天。</description></item></channel></rss>